---
import profile from '@/data/profile.json';
---

<section id="contact" class="section relative">
  <div class="container-x text-center">
    <p class="accent font-mono text-sm reveal">04. What's Next?</p>
    <h2 class="reveal text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold mt-3">Get In Touch</h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-5 max-w-xl mx-auto text-muted-light dark:text-muted-dark leading-relaxed">
      빠르게 변화하는 시장에서 사용자 관점의 효율을 최우선으로 고민합니다.
      <br>
      좋게 봐주신다면 기대에 부응하는 모습으로 보답하겠습니다.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="py-10 border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-slate-800/60">
  <div class="container-x text-center text-xs text-muted-light dark:text-muted-dark font-mono">
    <p>
      Designed & Built by <span class="accent">{profile.name}</span>
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 opacity-70">Built with Astro + Tailwind CSS · Deployed on GitHub Pages</p>
  </div>
</footer>
